### Login (run this first, copy the token from the response)
### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "Test@123"
}
> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Save week 1 (October)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/attendance/weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weekStartDate": "2026-10-05",
  "weekEndDate": "2026-10-09",
  "totalDays": 5,
  "entries": [
    { "studentId": "STU1001", "daysPresent": 5, "remarks": "" },
    { "studentId": "STU1002", "daysPresent": 3, "remarks": "Sick leave" }
  ]
}

### Generate September summary
POST http://localhost:8081/api/attendance/summary/generate?year=2026&month=9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### View September summary
GET http://localhost:8081/api/attendance/summary?year=2026&month=9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

